, bermata biru, yang pindah ke apartemen sebelah tempatnya. Gadis itu bernama Yui. Tampkanya dia benar-benar seorang wanita bangsawan, dan julukannya adalah “Coup de Lera” karena sikap acuh tak acuhnya di sekolah. Natsuomi mengetahui bahwa Yui tidak mau bergantung pada orang lain, tapi sebenarnya dia cukup naif, sehingga Natsuomi memutuskan untuk membantunya.\n“Hari ini kita malan malam apa… Ayam goreng, ‘kah?”\n“Benar, soalnya harga ayam sedang diskon hari ini”\n“Aku suka ayam goreng buatanmu, jadi aku sangat menantikannya”\n\nIni adalah awal dari hubungan manis dan menggiurkan di antara gadis dan pemuda yang tinggal bersebelahan.","year":2021,"status":"completed","lastChapter":"47","contentRating":"safe","tags":["Romance","Comedy","Slice of Life"],"poster":"https://uploads.mangadex.org/covers/7e5916f3-e271-4041-805a-23b932bb5b91/5f4bde12-23b8-41bd-bc5c-37e32373784d.jpg.512.jpg","originalLanguage":"ja","availableLanguages":["en","es-la","vi","id","pt-br"],"lane":"manga","rating":8.53,"follows":37038,"listAt":"2026-10-31T12:41:42.347Z","chapters":[{"id":"5bbe868f-6a60-42eb-94bb-f812a0005aca","number":"47","volume":null,"title":null,"lang":"en","pages":32,"createdAt":"2026-10-29T04:05:45+00:00","baked":true},{"id":"2e720617-ed7f-45fa-9624-b8fd8bb04fa5","number":"46","volume":null,"title":null,"lang":"en","pages":32,"createdAt":"2026-10-07T03:33:34+00:00","baked":true},{"id":"63d81fa1-e79c-4bf4-b263-027d947e9eca","number":"46","volume":null,"title":null,"lang":"en","pages":31,"createdAt":"2026-10-01T04:19:33+00:00","baked":true},{"id":"a008a021-e683-4814-a577-23ec8673afe9","number":"45","volume":null,"title":null,"lang":"en","pages":44,"createdAt":"2026-10-05T03:25:48+00:00","baked":true},{"id":"101f9cc7-fb27-45ba-be75-94ff29a59f9c","number":"45","volume":null,"title":null,"lang":"en","pages":44,"createdAt":"2026-08-29T15:11:33+00:00","baked":true},{"id":"924859ba-c55a-4fff-b28c-ed0f5c76ea88","number":"44","volume":null,"title":null,"lang":"en","pages":31,"createdAt":